#: src/global-fallback-justfile.md:1
msgid "Global Fallback Justfile"
msgstr ""

#: src/global-fallback-justfile.md:3
msgid ""
"A global fallback justfile may be set with `--global-fallback-justfile "
"<PATH>`, or by setting the `JUST_GLOBAL_FALLBACK_JUSTFILE` environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""

#: src/global-fallback-justfile.md:6
msgid ""
"If no justfile is found, or if the search for a fallback does not succeed, "
"the global fallback justfile is used instead. The working directory is set "
"to the root of the current project, as determined by the presence of a "
"directory like `.git`, or the invocation directory if no such directory is "
"found. The global fallback justfile may itself use `set fallback`."
msgstr ""

#: src/global-fallback-justfile.md:12
msgid ""
"The global fallback justfile is ignored when `--justfile`, `--global-"
"justfile`, or `--working-directory` is passed."
msgstr ""
